   "notes": "Definitions, colour convention (part 1: 2m colours, other parts: m) and quantifier ranges (even: k in N_+; odd: k in N including 0; n in N_+) all match, and MathDB 342364 matches the source. Under the per-k parse P1, the m=15 (k=3) empty equality set negates the literal conjunction. Under the existential parse P2 the conjecture is TRUE, and r130's full theorem proves it. So only the full theorem resolves the statement under both parses."
